  "39a9cfd3-c279-4860-9045-f134a09ea12b"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "gives the slab of the vertices ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " with ",
 StyleBox["lo \[LessEqual] d(p\:2081, v) \[Minus] d(p\:2082, v) \[LessEqual] \
hi", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"49dfd219-6c51-4f4a-8d64-065d68825ca5"],
 Cell[BoxData[
